mplete account and protect the sleepers from the air budget","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-4-1-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-13-1-1"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-4","characterId":"cold-choir-char-neve","type":"primary","text":"Determine what the Roll omits and place the evidence before the Compact","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-2-1-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-20-2-1"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-5","characterId":"cold-choir-char-jory","type":"primary","text":"Win safety and restitution for the Ninefold miners","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-2-2-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-20-2-1"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-6","characterId":"cold-choir-char-rhee","type":"primary","text":"Judge whether obedience can survive the evidence entrusted to her","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-5-2-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-20-3-1"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-7","characterId":"cold-choir-char-osh","type":"primary","text":"Complete the Ninefold expedition without surrendering her crew to Fane","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-3-1-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-21-2-2"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-8","characterId":"cold-choir-char-kit","type":"primary","text":"Keep reading every name that official history abandoned","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-6-1-1","endEventId":"cold-choir-event-21-2-2"},{"worldId":"the-cold-choir-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"cold-choir-goal-9","characterId":"cold-choir-char-saba","type":"primary","text":"Bring the crew through the Interdict Field alive","startEventId":"cold-choir-event-6-2-1","endEventId"